  "body": "<!-- THESIS: The user-selected studies form one connected Mycelium, with learning and community equally prominent.\nOWN-WORLD: Soil brown, forest, cool sage and stone; bold Manrope; photographic layers, plant sculpture and clear library controls.\nSTORY: Discover permaculture, find a starting point, and connect with others on Common Ground.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: Farm's seedling and large headline at home; panoramic type on About; big left-aligned titles and layered media in libraries. Equal learning/community actions remain on home.\nFORM: User-selected Farm-to-Fauna composition, Interstellar About and study-derived libraries. Selection key: mycelium-selected-studies-2026-10-16.\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md --><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"230px\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></a><button aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"menu-button\"><span>Menu</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></header>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"site-menu\" hidden=\"\" id=\"site-menu\"><div class=\"menu-links\"><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Videos</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/courses/\"><span>Courses</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/about/\"><span>My story</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/events/\"><span>Events</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/newsletter/\"><span>Newsletter</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/feedback/\"><span>Get in touch</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></nav><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"watch-intro\">\n<a class=\"watch-back\" href=\"/videos/#library\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg> All videos</a>\n<div class=\"watch-heading\"><h1>Polycrisis, Prepping, and Permaculture</h1><div class=\"watch-credit\"><p>With Hubert Posadas</p><div class=\"watch-tags\"><span>Philippines</span><span>Visual Learning</span></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#the-idea\">Take a closer look <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"watch-stage\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"watch-depth\"></div><div class=\"watch-screen\"><button aria-label=\"Play Polycrisis, Prepping, and Permaculture\" class=\"watch-poster\" data-watch-embed=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oBDceN7E5BI\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Hands holding rich, living soil\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 90vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-1400.webp 1400w\" width=\"1400\"/><span class=\"watch-play\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 32 32\"><path d=\"m12 7 14 9-14 9V7Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><span>Play film</span></span></button></div></div>\n<div class=\"watch-source-line\"><span>From the Mycelium video library</span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oBDceN7E5BI\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Open original source <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"watch-reading\" id=\"the-idea\"><div class=\"watch-reading-heading\"><h2>The idea.<br/>In practice.</h2><nav aria-label=\"On this page\"><a href=\"#the-idea\">About the film</a><a href=\"#the-educator\">The educator</a><a href=\"#watch-next\">Keep exploring</a></nav></div><div class=\"watch-prose\"><div class=\"vd-body-text\"> <p>Hubert Posadas breaks down the concept of polycrisis — what happens when climate, economic, social, and geopolitical crises hit simultaneously and compound on each other. He examines why the Philippines is particularly vulnerable, why the Western model of prepping doesn't translate to the Filipino context, and how bayanihan and indigenous permaculture practices offer a solid path to community preparedness.</p> </div><div class=\"watch-question\"><h3>What would you try?</h3><p>Take one idea into your own space, or bring a question to the community.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Discuss it in the Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"watch-educator\" id=\"the-educator\"><div><p>Learn alongside</p><h2>Hubert Posadas</h2><span>Filipino Permaculture Practitioner</span></div><div class=\"watch-bio\"><p class=\"vda-bio\">Hubert Posadas is a Filipino permaculture practitioner and community organizer leading the Bayanihan Project, a program that integrates modern permaculture with indigenous Filipino practices across six pilot communities nationwide. His work is rooted in the belief that food security and community resilience are inseparable, drawing on the Filipino value of bayanihan as the foundation for sustainable land stewardship.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/videos/?search=Hubert%20Posadas&amp;view=shelf#library\">More from this educator <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"watch-related\" id=\"watch-next\"><header><h2>Keep exploring.</h2><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Back to the library</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></header><div class=\"library-grid\"><article class=\"library-card filter-item\" data-category=\"philippines talk\" data-search=\"Preserving the Ancestral Domain Hubert Posadas philippines talk\"><a href=\"/video/preserving-the-ancestral-domain/\"><div class=\"library-cover\"><img alt=\"Preserving the Ancestral Domain\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/149f63bf-hqdefault-1b794ed8646b-480.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/149f63bf-hqdefault-1b794ed8646b-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/149f63bf-hqdefault-1b794ed8646b-480.webp 480w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"480\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Preserving the Ancestral Domain\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/149f63bf-hqdefault-1b794ed8646b-480.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/149f63bf-hqdefault-1b794ed8646b-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/149f63bf-hqdefault-1b794ed8646b-480.webp 480w\" width=\"480\"/></noscript><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"card-play\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"cover-label\">Talk</span></div><div class=\"library-card-meta\"><span>Philippines</span><span>01</span></div><h3>Preserving the Ancestral Domain</h3><p>Hubert Posadas</p></a></article><article class=\"library-card filter-item\" data-category=\"philippines visual-learning\" data-search=\"The Farm: Why the Philippines Can’t Feed Itself | Atty. Esteban Salonga with Baganihan Collective Hubert Posadas philippines visual-learning\"><a href=\"/video/the-farm-why-the-philippines-cant-feed-itself-atty-esteban-salonga-with-baganihan-collective/\"><div class=\"library-cover\"><img alt=\"The Farm: Why the Philippines Can’t Feed Itself | Atty. Esteban Salonga with Baganihan Colle